song "Wobble Study"
bpm 120
output "wobble.wav"
seed 7

instrument bass
    type wavetable
    oscillator saw
    filter lowpass cutoff 500hz resonance 0.7
    envelope attack 5ms decay 150ms sustain 0.7 release 180ms
    lfo rate 1/4 target filter.cutoff depth 350hz

pattern bassline
    c2 on 1 hold 0.75 beats
    g2 on 2 hold 0.75 beats
    bb1 on 3 hold 0.75 beats
    c2 on 4 hold 0.75 beats

pattern beat
    kick on 1, 2, 3, 4
    snare on 2, 4
    hihat every 1/8 vel 0.4

track bass instrument bass pattern bassline volume -9db
track drums instrument drums pattern beat volume -9db

section intro
    length 2 bars
    bass only
section build
    length 4 bars
    add drums
section outro
    length 2 bars
    remove drums

over 2 bars in build
    bass.filter.cutoff from 500hz to 2400hz
    drums.volume from -18db to -9db
